# Keep the build context small. Host virtualenvs in particular must never be
# shipped: they are platform-specific, useless inside the image, and get baked
# in by `COPY . .`. `.venv/` was already ignored but `.venv312/` was not, so
# ~506MB was being transferred on every build and layered into the image.
.venv/
.venv*/
venv/
var/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.env
*.db
*.sqlite3
